330
00:48:31,788 --> 00:48:43,548
I have read studies which used objects first approach in college levels, so it's possible.

331
00:48:46,867 --> 00:48:57,028
What do you say? In our circle, first we learn algorithms, then we learn structured programming, then we learn object orientation.

332
00:48:58,356 --> 00:49:10,096
So, you don't need to repeat yourself with the structured programming concepts as soon as possible.

